               <additional>
                  <adminInfo>
                     <availability>
                        <p>available</p>
                     </availability>
                     <note type="comment">The &lt;&lt;bKa' gdams gsung 'bum dkar chag [Z5WBK2VV]&gt;&gt;: 64 reports the signature "phyi zha 21" but no signature is visible on the images in the bKa' gdams gsung 'bum reproduction.&#13;
&lt;&lt;Hugon 2021 [J4L5X9AG]&gt;&gt; tentatively identified this item with no. 16376 in the &lt;&lt;'Bras spungs dkar chag [8H6M69W4]&gt;&gt; (phyi zha 21, dpe tshugs, 61.5x8cm, 102ff., tshad ma rnam par nges pa'i Tik+ka las mngon sum le'u bzhugs so, ne'u thog pa chos kyi bla ma'i slob ma chos kyi ye shes yin nam snyam).&#13;
However, No. 16376 seems to represent the first chapter of a work whose second chapter is listed as No. 16375 (phyi zha 21, dpe tshugs, 61.5x8cm, 106 ff., tshad ma rnam par nges pa'i Tik+ka las rang don le'u bzhugs so, ye shes dpal ste chos kyi ye shes min nam snyam brtag) (see respectively (ID:6014) and (ID:6013)), whereas the instance under consideration contains a commentary on all three chapters of the Pramāṇaviniścaya. No corresponding entry could be located in the [8H6M69W4].</note>
                  </adminInfo>
                  <listBibl>
                     <bibl>
                        <ref target="https://www.zotero.org/groups/4394244/tibschol/items/UJDXNMGD">bKa' gdams gsung 'bum 2</ref>, <biblScope unit="vol">44</biblScope>, <biblScope unit="pp">253-456</biblScope>, <biblScope unit="text">5</biblScope>
                     </bibl>
                  </listBibl>
